      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah, thou art my God; I will exalt thee, I will praise thy name; for thou hast done wonderful things, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " counsels of old, in faithfulness ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou hast made of a city a heap, of a fortified city a ruin, a palace of strangers to be no city; it shall never be built. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore shall a strong people glorify thee; a city of terrible nations shall fear thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou hast been a stronghold to the poor, a stronghold to the needy in his distress, a refuge from the storm, a shade from the heat, when the blast of the terrible ones is as a storm against the wall. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the heat in a dry place wilt thou bring down the noise of strangers; as the heat by the shade of a cloud, the song of the terrible ones shall be brought low.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in this mountain will Jehovah of hosts make unto all peoples a feast of fat things, a feast of wines on the lees, of fat things full of marrow, of wines on the lees well refined. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he will destroy in this mountain the face of the covering that covereth all peoples, and the veil that is spread over all nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath swallowed up death for ever; and the Lord Jehovah will wipe away tears from off all faces; and the reproach of his people will he take away from off all the earth: for Jehovah hath spoken it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall be said in that day, Lo, this is our God; we have waited for him, and he will save us: this is Jehovah; we have waited for him, we will be glad and rejoice in his salvation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For in this mountain will the hand of Jehovah rest; and Moab shall be trodden down in his place, even as straw is trodden down in the water of the dunghill. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall spread forth his hands in the midst thereof, as he that swimmeth spreadeth forth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to swim; but ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will lay low his pride together with the craft of his hands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the high fortress of thy walls hath he brought down, laid low, and brought to the ground, even to the dust.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
